  "slug": "adjetivos-an-on-or",
  "titulo": "Adjectives in -án, -ón, -or",
  "subtitulo": "Él es trabajador; ella es trabajadora.",
  "foto": "t03.jpg",
  "regla": "Adjectives ending in -án, -ón and -or add -a for the feminine and -es / -as for the plural, and the written accent of -án and -ón disappears: llorón → llorona, llorones, lloronas. Comparatives like mayor, menor, mejor and peor don't take -a.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Most adjectives ending in **-án**, **-ón** or **-or** describe personality: **trabajador**, **hablador**, **llorón**, **dormilón**, **mandón**, **holgazán**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Feminine: add **-a**. Plural: add **-es** (masculine) or **-as** (feminine)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Masc. sing.",
            "Fem. sing.",
            "Masc. pl.",
            "Fem. pl."
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "trabajador",
              "trabajadora",
              "trabajadores",
              "trabajadoras"
            ],
            [
              "llorón",
              "llorona",
              "llorones",
              "lloronas"
            ],
            [
              "holgazán",
              "holgazana",
              "holgazanes",
              "holgazanas"
            ],
            [
              "dormilón",
              "dormilona",
              "dormilones",
              "dormilonas"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The accent on **-án** and **-ón** is only in the masculine singular. Add a syllable and it goes: **llorón → llorona, llorones**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Exception: comparatives in **-or** have one form for both genders: **mayor, menor, mejor, peor, superior, inferior**. **Mi hermana mayor**, never _mayora_."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
