              "en": "My surf teacher is quite chatty."
            },
            {
              "es": "Los gatos de mi casa son muy ==comilones==.",
              "en": "The cats at my place are big eaters."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tus primas son un poco ==mandonas==.",
              "en": "Your cousins are a bit bossy."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi hermana ==mayor== vive en Ensenada.",
